+// WARNING! SUBCLASSES MUST CALL Deinit() IN THEIR DESTRUCTORS!
+// This is required to avoid a data race between the destructor modifying the
+// vtable, and the media channel's thread using BaseChannel as the
+// NetworkInterface.
